dance Groove
// The bass pushes the morph; the snares bring it nearer; the kicks set how fast it spins and the
// bass turns it; drops in the bass reverse it.
// Inspired by default style, a DancerDNA music style.

morph   follows music.bass  speed 0.88  settle 0.08
zoom    follows music.mid_hit  amount 0.5  settle 50
spin    follows music.bass_hit  from 45.8 to 172  smooth 0.4
turn    on music.bass changes  by 1
reverse on music.bass drops  by 1  on 4 off 4
